@startuml
actor "Driver App" as DriverApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Dispatching Service" as Dispatch
participant "Trip & Route Service" as TripSvc
database "DB" as DB

DriverApp -> API : GET /me/assignments (today)
API -> Auth : validate driver token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> Dispatch : list assignments
Dispatch -> DB : query assignments for driver
DB --> Dispatch : data
Dispatch --> API : list
API --> DriverApp : list

DriverApp -> API : GET /trips/{id}/detail
API -> TripSvc : fetch trip, route, stops
TripSvc -> DB : query
DB --> TripSvc : data
TripSvc --> API : detail
API --> DriverApp : show map & steps
@enduml